WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.235
Apple Silicon has become a practical platform for local AI experimentation, private assistants, coding support, document analysis, and homelab-style workflows.

00:00:11.235 --> 00:00:18.300
A modern Mac can run useful local language models without a separate desktop tower or cloud account.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:26.779
That makes it attractive for people who want hands-on learning, controlled data handling, and a portable AI workstation.

00:00:26.779 --> 00:00:30.383
The key architectural difference is unified memory.

00:00:30.383 --> 00:00:36.671
In many traditional systems, the CPU has system RAM and a discrete GPU has separate VRAM.

00:00:36.671 --> 00:00:42.819
Apple Silicon uses a shared memory pool that CPU, GPU, and other components can access.

00:00:42.819 --> 00:00:52.004
This can make some local model workflows easier to fit than a low-VRAM discrete GPU system, but it does not make memory unlimited.

00:00:52.004 --> 00:00:55.749
Local inference is different from hosted AI services.

00:00:55.749 --> 00:01:00.907
With hosted services, the provider operates the model and infrastructure.

00:01:00.907 --> 00:01:09.951
On Apple Silicon, the user chooses the model file, runtime, quantization, context length, storage location, and privacy posture.

00:01:09.951 --> 00:01:18.854
That control is useful, but it also means the user owns troubleshooting, updates, performance expectations, and data handling.

00:01:18.854 --> 00:01:25.567
MacBooks, Mac minis, Mac Studios, and desktop-style setups each have strengths and limitations.

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:29.877
A laptop is portable but may face battery and thermal limits.

00:01:29.877 --> 00:01:34.964
A desktop Mac can be quieter and more stable for long-running workloads.

00:01:34.964 --> 00:01:42.595
In every case, hardware, model choice, runtime, quantization, and context settings must be planned together.

00:01:42.595 --> 00:01:48.743
The goal is useful local inference, not simply proving that a large file can load once.
